 "text": "Hello, how are things going? The autumn is lovely, the leaves turning and the nights getting shorter don't count against it. I can be there in an hour. Are you at spot I can spot from the road? Okay, meet me at the usual spot. I' show you the lock I used. Good idea. Sit somewhere with window light. Come on. We' get the lock picked and you and your wife can go somewhere quiet. Then think of it as a rest stop before the honeymoon. A chance to relax before the real trip starts.",
